      "created_at": "2018-05-16T08:24:47Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-05-16T08:24:47Z",
      "body": "It might be enough to \"anonymize\" IP address by truncating the least-significant 16 bits (in IPv4) or 64 (or perhaps 96) bits in IPv6. That's probably still enough to report country, but not uniquely identify anyone.",
